      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Perform mobility update to attempt recovery from suspected data stalls.</para>
          <para>If set, the gateway connection will monitor the data stall detection of the VCN network. When there is a suspected data stall, the gateway connection will attempt recovery by performing a mobility update on the underlying IKE session.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/vcn/VcnGatewayConnectionConfig#VCN_GATEWAY_OPTION_ENABLE_DATA_STALL_RECOVERY_WITH_MOBILITY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.vcn.VcnGatewayConnectionConfig.VCN_GATEWAY_OPTION_ENABLE_DATA_STALL_RECOVERY_WITH_MOBILITY</code>.</a></format></para>
